Apply ComfyUI's scaled-FP8 weight scales when importing safetensors

The importer decoded ComfyUI's scaled E4M3 weights but ignored their
weight_scale and scale_weight entries. Wrap the archive rather than set
ModelWeightElement.scale, so that a gather over several source tensors
applies each source's own scale.
